        <div class="page-shell about-page-intro">
            <span class="eyebrow">Quickler in South Africa</span>
            <h1>WhatsApp field compliance software for South African firms.</h1>
            <p class="page-lede">Field firms in South Africa run inspections, checklists and certificates over WhatsApp, with no app to install and no per-user fee. A field worker answers on the phone they already carry, and the answers become a clean structured digital record on a manager dashboard. From spaza shop site checks to electrical compliance work and fleet walkrounds, the record is live, machine-readable and graded red, amber or green, with a PDF export available the moment a document is needed.</p>
        </div>
